<title>POLAND: IMPEXMETAL JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>IMPEXMETAL JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
